style_chapter__grtAe">11</strong><h1>Design A Notification System</h1></hea=
der><p>A notification system has already become a very popular feature for =
many applications in recent years. A notification alerts a user with import=
ant information like breaking news, product updates, events, offerings, etc=
. It has become an indispensable part of our daily life. In this chapter, y=
ou are asked to design a notification system.</p>
<p>A notification is more than just mobile push notification. Three types o=
f notification formats are: mobile push notification, SMS message, and Emai=
l. Figure 1 shows an example of each of these notifications.</p>
