<h3 id=3D"contact-info-gathering-flow">Contact info gathering flow</h3>
<p>To send notifications, we need to gather mobile device tokens, phone num=
bers, or email addresses. As shown in Figure 7, when a user installs our ap=
p or signs up for the first time, API servers collect user contact info and=
 store it in the database.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a simplified system architecture diagram fo=
r user contact information storage.  A light-blue box labeled 'User' contai=
