<h4 id=3D"events-tracking">Events tracking</h4>
<p>Notification metrics, such as open rate, click rate, and engagement are =
important in understanding customer behaviors. Analytics service implements=
 events tracking. Integration between the notification system and the analy=
tics service is usually required. Figure 13 shows an example of events that=
 might be tracked for analytics purposes.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a state diagram illustrating the lifecycle =
